A chart creates a random password only if the Secret doesn't exist yet:

```yaml
{{- $existing := lookup "v1" "Secret" .Release.Namespace "db-auth" }}
{{- if not $existing }}
password: {{ randAlphaNum 24 | b64enc }}
{{- end }}
```

The team deploys with Argo CD, which renders charts with `helm template`. Every sync generates a new password. Why?
